[D Quests for Razorfen Downs \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[N 35-41 Razorfen Downs]
[NX 40-52 Krol dok Stronghold]

-- Left out: 93604 Agamaggan's Blood (end of a ten-step Shen'dralas chain from Feralas that also needs a step in Maraudon; not a Razorfen Downs pickup).

-- Horde: Undercity, then Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff and Mulgore, then Camp Taurajo and the road south.
[A Horde] Get to the Undercity gate; Undead start close by, the others take the zeppelin from Durotar [G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades]
[A Horde] Down the lift into the Trade Quarter [G56.8,17.2 Undercity] [OC] \\ Malus (level 29) near the lift may attack.
[A Horde] Along the Trade Quarter ring [G56.8,36.0 Undercity] [OC]
[A Horde] At Michael Garrett, get the Undercity flight path [P Undercity] [G63.1,48.3 Undercity] \\ Alyz (level 27) near the flight master may attack.
[A Horde] Through the Magic Quarter [G73.2,40.0 Undercity] [OC]
[A Horde] Andrew Brownell gives [QA3341 Bring the End] [G74.0,33.3 Undercity] \\ Needs level 37.
[A Horde] Back south through the Magic Quarter [G74.0,52.2 Undercity] [OC]
[A Horde] Through the Apothecarium [G66.5,71.0 Undercity] [OC]
[A Horde] Into the Royal Quarter [G56.5,87.2 Undercity] [OC]
[A Horde] If you looted the Small Scroll from Charlga Razorflank in Razorfen Kraul, read it to start [QA6522 An Unholy Alliance] \\ Without the scroll, skip this and the next step.
[A Horde] Varimathras takes [QT6522 An Unholy Alliance] and then gives [QA6521 An Unholy Alliance] [G56.2,92.2 Undercity] \\ Needs the scroll quest done first. Anya Rince (level 52) and a Darkspear Emissary (level 30) close by may attack.
[A Horde] Leave Undercity: north through the city, up the lift and out through the ruins [G56.8,73.5 Undercity][G56.8,54.7 Undercity][G56.8,17.2 Undercity][G61.8,65.0 Tirisfal Glades]
[A Horde] Walk north to the zeppelin towers [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]
[A Horde] Take the zeppelin to Durotar [G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades] \\ A Decrepit Harvester (elite, level 8) roams near the towers.
[A Horde] Walk west from the tower to the Orgrimmar gate [G45.5,12.0 Durotar] \\ A Dustwind Eggtender (elite, level 12) lives south of the tower, and an Infernal (elite, level 30) may stand on the flats east of the gate.
[A Horde] Through the Valley of Strength [G52.0,82.0 Orgrimmar][G47.5,71.0 Orgrimmar] [OC]
[A Horde] At Doras, get the Orgrimmar flight path [P Orgrimmar] [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar]
[A Horde] Fly to Thunder Bluff from Doras [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] \\ Uses the Thunder Bluff flight path from earlier guides, so no flight tag here. If you lack it, walk: out of Orgrimmar, west across the Barrens by the Crossroads and up into Mulgore.
[A Horde] At Tal, get the Thunder Bluff flight path [P Thunder Bluff] [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff]
[A Horde] Walk to the north lift [G42.0,34.6 Thunder Bluff] \\ Arrgrah Stonewall (level 38) near the flight master may attack.
[A Horde] Ride down and run north across the plains [G39.0,33.1 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore] [OC] \\ Enforcer Emilgund and Sister Hatelash (elite, level 11) may be near.
[A Horde] Turn west up onto the Skywatcher Plateau [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore] [OC] \\ Gloomrise Soldiers and Gnawed Corpses (level 28-29) may be near.
[A Horde] Sutara Plainstalker at Camp Gev'rek gives [QA97196 The Coldbringer's Eye] [G34.6,23.0 Mulgore] \\ Needs level 34.
[A Horde] Back down the plateau and south across the plains to the lift [G35.0,22.5 Mulgore][G40.0,25.0 Mulgore][G39.0,33.1 Mulgore] [OC]
[A Horde] Up the lift to Tal [G42.0,34.6 Thunder Bluff][G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff] [OC]
[A Horde] Fly to Camp Taurajo from Tal [G47.0,49.8 Thunder Bluff] \\ Uses the Camp Taurajo flight path from the Razorfen Kraul guide, so no flight tag here. If you lack it, walk: down the lift, east across Mulgore and south on the Barrens road to Camp Taurajo.
[A Horde] At Omusa Thunderhorn, get the Camp Taurajo flight path [P Camp Taurajo] [G44.5,59.1 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Leave Camp Taurajo by the road south [G45.5,66.0 The Barrens]

-- Alliance: Stormwind, the boat to Auberdine and a flight to Ratchet. The Dalaran trip for 96773 is an optional block.
[A Alliance] In Stormwind, at Dungar Longdrink, get the Stormwind flight path [P Stormwind] [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] In the Cathedral of Light, Archbishop Benedictus gives [QA3636 Bring the Light] [G50.3,45.5 Stormwind City] \ Needs level 39; without it, skip this step and its turn-in.
[A Alliance] Walk west to the harbor pier [G36.5,45.2 Stormwind City][G29.6,54.1 Stormwind City][G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Take the boat to Auberdine [G21.8,56.9 Stormwind City]
[A Alliance] Walk up the pier into Auberdine [G30.5,40.9 Darkshore][G32.7,41.9 Darkshore][G37.0,44.0 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] At Caylais Moonfeather, get the Auberdine flight path [P Auberdine] [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] Optional, level 34 and up: the Dalaran pickup for The Coldbringer's Eye. Archmage Lan'dalock gives it before the dungeon and takes it after, so it costs two visits; skip this block and its turn-in block and you lose nothing else. \\ QuestieDB flags Lan'dalock as hostile; players report he is the Alliance quest giver.
[A Alliance] Optional: walk to the south pier [G37.0,44.0 Darkshore][G32.3,44.1 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] Optional: take the Menethil boat and stay on board until Southshore [G32.3,44.1 Darkshore] \\ It may call at Menethil Harbor first.
[A Alliance] Optional: walk up into Southshore [G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50.0,58.0 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC] \\ Bob McNaught (level 40), Crimeon (28) and Southshore Defenders (55) in and by Southshore may attack.
[A Alliance] Optional: at Darla Harris, get the Southshore flight path [P Southshore] [G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] Optional: north-west across the hills [G40.9,33.7 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC] \\ Yetis (level 30-32) sit in the caves to the west.
[A Alliance] Optional: on north-west toward Alterac [G32.9,15.0 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC]
[A Alliance] Optional: to the road below Dalaran [G22.5,82.0 Alterac Mountains] [OC] \\ An elite Arcane Sentry (level 55) may stand by it.
[A Alliance] Optional: up into Dalaran by the south gate [G18.2,76.9 Alterac Mountains] [OC]
[A Alliance] Optional: Archmage Lan'dalock, outside the Violet Hold, gives [QA96773 The Coldbringer's Eye] [G15.3,73.9 Alterac Mountains] \\ QuestieDB also flags Archmage Timear (elite, level 55) beside him as hostile.
[A Alliance] Optional: back out of Dalaran and down to the road [G18.2,76.9 Alterac Mountains][G22.5,82.0 Alterac Mountains] [OC]
[A Alliance] Optional: south-east across the hills to Southshore [G32.9,15.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G40.9,33.7 Hillsbrad Foothills][G49.4,52.1 Hillsbrad Foothills] [OC]
[A Alliance] Optional: down to the pier [G50.0,58.0 Hillsbrad Foothills][G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] Optional: take the boat back to Auberdine [G50.7,70.4 Hillsbrad Foothills]
[A Alliance] Optional: walk back to Caylais [G32.3,44.1 Darkshore][G37.0,44.0 Darkshore][G36.4,45.6 Darkshore]
[A Alliance] Fly to Ratchet from Caylais [G36.4,45.6 Darkshore] \\ Uses the Ratchet flight path from the Wailing Caverns guide, so no flight tag here. If you lack it, walk: east out of Auberdine, south through Ashenvale and down the Barrens road to Ratchet.
[A Alliance] At Bragok, get the Ratchet flight path [P Ratchet] [G63.1,37.1 The Barrens] \\ Bruuz (elite, level 20) and a Ratchet Enforcer (level 57) may attack.
[A Alliance] Leave Ratchet by the road north-west [G59.0,34.0 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Take the road south-west [G55.5,38.6 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Keep south-west on the road past Lushwater Oasis [G52.0,43.8 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Follow the road south [G50.4,49.8 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Pass east of Camp Taurajo, well clear of its guards [G47.5,58.0 The Barrens]
[A Alliance] Rejoin the road south [G45.5,66.0 The Barrens]

Keep south on the road [G44.7,78.2 The Barrens]
Go on south to the top of the Great Lift [G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] \\ The thorn maze to the east is full of elite Razorfen Battleguards, Thornweavers and Death's Head Cultists (level 33-34), Withered Warriors, Withered Spearhides and Death's Head Geomancers (elite, level 34-36), and Ambassadors Bloodrage and Malcin (elite, level 36).
East into the thorn maze [G46.2,90.6 The Barrens] [OC]
Follow the path south-east [G47.3,92.4 The Barrens] [OC]
Keep south-east [G48.5,94.2 The Barrens] [OC]
Myriam Moonsinger gives [QA6626 A Host of Evil] [G49.0,94.9 The Barrens]
[OC] Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguards [QC6626,1 A Host of Evil], 8 Razorfen Thornweavers [QC6626,2 A Host of Evil] and 8 Death's Head Cultists [QC6626,3 A Host of Evil] in the thorn maze; all are elite.
[A Horde] Ambassador Malcin stands at one of the tent camps: first try the one just south [G48.5,95.5 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Then the camp to the north [G48.0,92.4 The Barrens]
[A Horde] Then the first tent by the maze entrance [G46.2,90.2 The Barrens] \\ Kill him and take his head [QC6521 An Unholy Alliance]. He fights with several elites around him; bring a group.
[A Horde] Back south-east to Myriam [G47.3,92.4 The Barrens][G48.5,94.2 The Barrens] [OC]
Myriam Moonsinger takes [QT6626 A Host of Evil] [G49.0,94.9 The Barrens]
Walk north to the dungeon entrance [G49.0,93.9 The Barrens]

Inside Razorfen Downs:
Belnistrasz in the Murder Pens gives [QA3523 Scourge of the Downs] and takes it back at once [QT3523 Scourge of the Downs] \\ He then offers Extinguishing the Idol. Let every group member turn in Scourge of the Downs before anyone starts the escort.
Accept [QA3525 Extinguishing the Idol] when the whole group is ready; waves of quilboar come while Belnistrasz works at the idol [QC3525 Extinguishing the Idol]
Click Belnistrasz's Brazier at the idol when the ritual is over [QT3525 Extinguishing the Idol]
[A Horde] Kill Amnennar the Coldbringer at the top of the spiral path and take his skull [QC3341 Bring the End]
[A Alliance] Kill Amnennar the Coldbringer at the top of the spiral path [QC3636 Bring the Light]
[A Horde] Take The Coldbringer's Eye, the blue orb beside Amnennar [QC97196 The Coldbringer's Eye] \\ Loot it soon after the first group member does; players report it stops being lootable after about 30 seconds.
[A Alliance] Take The Coldbringer's Eye, the blue orb beside Amnennar [QC96773 The Coldbringer's Eye] \\ Loot it soon after the first group member does; players report it stops being lootable after about 30 seconds.

Leave the instance and walk back to the top of the Great Lift [G48.5,94.2 The Barrens][G47.3,92.4 The Barrens][G46.2,90.6 The Barrens][G45.0,90.0 The Barrens] \\ The same elites (level 33-36) are on the way.
Run north up the road [G44.7,78.2 The Barrens]

